  "term": "teenage pregnancy",
  "definition": "Teenage pregnancy is pregnancy in a girl during her teenage years. In the source packet, it is described as often unexpected and unwanted, and as a stigmatized experience that can involve hiding the pregnancy, social isolation, strained family or partner relationships, and too little material or emotional support.",
